{
    "word": "enclave",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                "word": "enclave",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6605fb2e-d155-4285-b76d-b6f4b6174d77",
                        "entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "enclaves"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea1293d0-ba00-354a-963f-c6960c681197",
                        "entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A political, cultural or social entity or part thereof that is completely surrounded by another."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f382ebb5-d863-4849-9cba-17fb8baaad1a",
                                "sense_id": "ea1293d0-ba00-354a-963f-c6960c681197",
                                "text": "The Republic of San Marino is an enclave of Italy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9af81a2-d172-48e5-b852-6feac25a83f6",
                                "sense_id": "ea1293d0-ba00-354a-963f-c6960c681197",
                                "text": "The streets around Union Square form a Protestant enclave within an otherwise Catholic neighbourhood."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ba8b862-fa17-3b54-bea6-1dcfa33041b0",
                        "entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A group that is set off from a larger population by its characteristic or behavior."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9cf8aed-967d-4bb0-a7b5-50ef042e0c6c",
                                "sense_id": "9ba8b862-fa17-3b54-bea6-1dcfa33041b0",
                                "text": "They were learning to do what in all my years in the music business I never saw — which was women running a record company, women producing concerts, women learning to be engineers, women moving into this absolutely all-male enclave. You never saw a woman in any of those positions, in any of that work except as secretaries and \"go-fers\"."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78497d2a-3ec0-4ecf-bcd5-75c1464ea965",
                                "sense_id": "9ba8b862-fa17-3b54-bea6-1dcfa33041b0",
                                "text": "What is unbearable, in fact, is the feeling, 13 years after 9/11, that America has been chasing its tail; that, in some whack-a-mole horror show, the quashing of a jihadi enclave here only spurs the sprouting of another there; that the ideology of Al Qaeda is still reverberating through a blocked Arab world whose Sunni-Shia balance (insofar as that went) was upended by the American invasion of Iraq."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bd59bc5-a615-41f8-8c54-14ad59aace4f",
                                "sense_id": "9ba8b862-fa17-3b54-bea6-1dcfa33041b0",
                                "text": "Since 2013, he has become a guru for the US-based far-right movement neoreaction, or NRx as it often calls itself. Neoreactionaries believe in the replacement of modern nation-states, democracy and government bureaucracies by authoritarian city states, which on neoreaction blogs sound as much like idealised medieval kingdoms as they do modern enclaves such as Singapore."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df83f916-3f4e-3eae-a055-368821b5921b",
                        "entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An isolated portion of an application's address space, such that data in an enclave can only be accessed by code in the same enclave."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c027daf-3276-45dd-8ff0-9212487aeb87",
                                "sense_id": "df83f916-3f4e-3eae-a055-368821b5921b",
                                "text": "When an enclave spans a system boundary in a sysplex, it is called a multisystem enclave."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60ef8d07-fc62-4b38-8ac8-d48e9bf0a71a",
                        "source_entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                        "source_sense_description": "entity completely surrounded by another",
                        "target_lang_word": "enclave",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enclave",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9391c161-5a09-329e-b30c-14ce30b825cc",
                                        "entry_id": "03456437-3518-3563-bbfe-05064339ca5a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "stuk grond dat door vreemd grondgebied is ingesloten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b135313f-1cb1-4096-83c9-f2c51dc8fcef",
                                                "sense_id": "9391c161-5a09-329e-b30c-14ce30b825cc",
                                                "text": "Baarle-Hertog is een Belgische enclave binnen Nederland."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbc35b73-ca14-4753-8c80-09623a573c5c",
                                                "sense_id": "9391c161-5a09-329e-b30c-14ce30b825cc",
                                                "text": "Een dorpse enclave op een kleine veertien vierkante kilometer in het hart van de stad Hempstead, compleet met drie golfclubs die allemaal hun best deden om de exclusiefste te zijn en daarmee ook meteen de meest geslotene waren."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "408d807f-033f-46bb-8147-4a212b1055f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "512efe3b-fcbb-3f4f-9465-936f6db61fc7",
                        "source_sense_description": "entity completely surrounded by another",
                        "target_lang_word": "enclave",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enclave",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d304be1-7791-367f-81c4-5c88453a83b6",
                                        "entry_id": "d06e4c70-d33a-3b79-a2ff-29e19a954a08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Terrain, territoire entièrement enfermé dans un autre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7466d36-735b-49aa-97d0-ea425c254c5b",
                                                "sense_id": "0d304be1-7791-367f-81c4-5c88453a83b6",
                                                "text": "Cette prairie est une enclave qui appartient à un tel et qui lui donne un droit de passage sur ma propriété."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0562015a-709d-44f8-8101-9a2330c23461",
                                                "sense_id": "0d304be1-7791-367f-81c4-5c88453a83b6",
                                                "text": "Cette terre fait une enclave ou fait enclave dans la vôtre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13c5607e-a3e8-369a-9144-e9e6a7913961",
                                        "entry_id": "d06e4c70-d33a-3b79-a2ff-29e19a954a08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Territoire, pays qui est enclavé, enfermé dans un autre, entièrement ou en partie, sans en dépendre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4f732e1-97b9-4165-8f3f-6c0972369165",
                                                "sense_id": "13c5607e-a3e8-369a-9144-e9e6a7913961",
                                                "text": "Tous espèrent atteindre l'autre continent, soit en traversant le détroit de Gibraltar, notamment via les enclaves espagnoles de Ceuta et Melilla, soit en empruntant des barques motorisées (pateras ou feloukas) depuis les côtes atlantiques vers les îles Canaries (espagnoles)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "497e1150-1c5d-4ff3-acc7-419a28ca199d",
                                                "sense_id": "13c5607e-a3e8-369a-9144-e9e6a7913961",
                                                "text": "La bizarrerie administrative dont elle est victime, Othe s'en accommode depuis fort longtemps. Pensez donc ! Depuis 1790 (création des départements) qu'elle vit avec son statut d’enclave meurthe-et-mosellane en territoire meusien, elle s’est fait une raison."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa66ac05-62cb-3e0f-9415-e69efbf1613c",
                                        "entry_id": "d06e4c70-d33a-3b79-a2ff-29e19a954a08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ouvrage engagé dans un autre et empiétant sur lui."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61c1e326-6d9f-4721-97fd-57226fab2471",
                                                "sense_id": "aa66ac05-62cb-3e0f-9415-e69efbf1613c",
                                                "text": "Cet escalier fait enclave sur les appartements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5e811c2-d0ef-3f76-8d20-4027035b2645",
                                        "entry_id": "d06e4c70-d33a-3b79-a2ff-29e19a954a08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inclusion d'une roche dans une autre roche magmatique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aedcaf95-5cc6-41d6-a517-b93afe6b7676",
                                                "sense_id": "d5e811c2-d0ef-3f76-8d20-4027035b2645",
                                                "text": "La rockallite […] constitue un accident, une enclave de couleur plus foncée à grains très fins comparables aux enclaves amphiboliques de nos granits, mais de composition différente."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "enclave",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a8dde75-3b12-3e00-b855-869b93b38f95",
                                        "entry_id": "a9a7d8b2-65cf-3968-b627-c9bd0cf85e6f",
